|CKBThief|000

|CK0Thieves turn information, access, preparation, and timing into power. They
support stealthy exploration and ordinary PvE as well as dirty combat, poison,
traps, burglary, and social manipulation.|000

|CKBHow it plays|000
|CK0Case studies a mark and creates Opportunity. Setup actions create Bleeding,
Exposed, concealment, or positional advantages; dirty techniques then spend
Opportunity for control or a prepared finish. Combat earns Guild XP, while each
Rank grants a Knack point for Ghost, Grifter, or Knife specialization.|000

|CKBCore skills|000
|CK0case prepares a target, quickstrike opens a wound, dirtyfight spends
Opportunity on tricks, sidestep provides evasive footwork, conceal and vanish
manage stealth, detect finds hidden dangers, and poisons, traps, pick, palm,
pilfer, and breakin support criminal work.|000

|CKBBest fit|000
|CK0Choose Thief if you enjoy setup and payoff, stealth, utility, crafting
poisons or traps, and solving encounters through preparation rather than
standing still and trading blows.|000

|CK0After joining, use |CKBthelp revival|CK0, |CKBtstatus|CK0, and
|CKBknacks|CK0 for the complete system.|000

